17
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,170
Such a close relationship.

18
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,970
No wonder you trust her so much.

19
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,560
It was out of trust.

20
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:18,960
The first time Lijuan and her son came,

21
