25
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,460
So she hasn't paid back this million?

26
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,840
Not only did they not pay it back,

27
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,840
but after a while,

28
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:41,079
