38
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:06,120
Our two houses have already been mortgaged.

39
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,120
My mom also got seriously ill

40
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,760
and was just discharged from the hospital a couple of days ago.

41
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,840
Well, I carry my medicine every day.

42
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,560
Lijuan,

43
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,180
it's not that I don't want to help you,

44
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:24,000
but I've lent you all my savings,

45
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,560
as well as my mom's pension.

46
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,400
Huilan, you...

47
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,000
Look at me,

48
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,000
