49
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,120
If we can't turn things around this time,

50
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:39,720
we won't be able to pay back the money we borrowed from you before.

51
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,280
If that happens,

52
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,000
