53
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,840
How can I face Auntie?

54
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,520
I...

55
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,960
Forget it, Mom.

56
00:03:49,079 --> 00:03:51,000
Let's not make things difficult for Godmother.

57
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,600
The practical difficulties are obvious.

58
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,680
We can't ask Godmother to mortgage her house

59
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,440
to help us.

60
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,840
Let's go back.

61
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,280
Hold her.

62
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,400
Mom, slow down.

63
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:03,800
Come.

64
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,400
Lijuan.

65
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,840
ID number: 210340199309167831.

66
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,700
ID number: 210340199309167831.

67
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:21,279
You mean you mortgaged your house

68
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,560
