83
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:04,680
That's the only house my mom and I have.

84
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,280
I understand. Yes, don't worry.

85
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:09,240
My mom is not in good health now.

86
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,720
She definitely can't handle any more stress.

87
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,720
I understand. Let's figure out a way first.

88
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,720
It's okay, ma'am.

89
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,880
I've read this IOU.

90
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,000
There's no problem,

91
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,160
and the interest is reasonable.

92
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,080
Right, look.

93
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:21,400
The IOU is fine, so we have a case.

94
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:21,880
Since we have a case,

95
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,440
