102
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:41,840
Even if I pay a little more, it's fine.

103
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,280
How about this, ma'am?

104
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,840
We can do a contingency fee.

105
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,280
What does contingency fee mean?

106
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,159
It means we fight the lawsuit first and collect the fee later.

107
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,720
What if we lose the case?

108
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,080
We won't charge a single cent.

109
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:55,920
But if we win,

110
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,780
the fee will be a little higher than the market rate.

111
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,280
Miss.

112
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,720
I think it's fine.

113
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:05,280
