114
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,360
Take care, Aunt Fang.

115
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,020
Careful now. Watch your step.

116
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,920
Have a safe trip back.

117
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,920
Just wait for our news.

118
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,800
Don't worry too much.

119
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,000
Aunt Fang, call me if you need anything.

120
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,940
We're definitely going to win this case, right?

121
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,600
Who can guarantee a 100% win in these cases?

122
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,280
I wouldn't dare.

123
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,000
Understood.

124
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,530
