126
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:30,280
Meaning, once we win this lawsuit...

127
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,280
Does that mean out of the 300,000 contingency fee,

128
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:33,360
I get 60,000?

129
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,000
Is that all you think about?

130
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,600
No.

131
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:38,000
Don't worry. I keep my promise.

132
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,120
Great. Let me just confirm.

133
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,840
Once we win this case,

134
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:45,370
does Dong Beihu get 60,000 out of the 300,000?

135
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:47,240
Are you recording me?

136
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,880
Applying what I've learned.

137
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,370
Let me record it for you.

138
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,380
Dong Beihu,

139
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,720
