140
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,040
I knew it. I...

141
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,159
You keep your promise, right?

142
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:00,360
Promise, promise, promise.

143
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,360
Okay. Come.

144
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,240
Look at my promise too.

145
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,240
What is it?

146
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:06,000
As the marketing director of our company,

147
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,040
I dedicated half of my minivan

148
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,160
