151
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,840
Always finding ways to scam money.

152
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:14,360
Come on.

153
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,280
Who told you to print my phone number on it?

154
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,280
It's for promotion.

155
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,840
It's my privacy.

156
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,360
See? Isn't it effective?

157
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,720
Hello, Uncle Li.

158
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,520
What's wrong?

159
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:29,240
He wants to make a comeback. He's crazy.

160
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,400
Uncle Li, pin him down for me.

161
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,240
Pin him down.

162
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,280
No, where are you going?

163
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,600
Let's use the company car.

164
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,840
No need. My little scooter is fine.

165
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,159
No, if you don't use it,

166
00:07:36,159 --> 00:07:38,280
