186
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,240
You know?

187
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,240
As long as you use this drink I exclusively represent,

188
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,360
I guarantee your business will be safe.

189
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,480
Absolutely safe.

190
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,280
Absolutely safe.

191
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,280
Stop pretending.

192
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,080
