194
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,570
Come on, what are you doing?

195
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,980
What are you doing?

196
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,400
What the hell? What are you doing?

197
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:31,460
What are you doing?

198
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,360
What are you doing? What is this?

199
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:32,840
What?

200
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,280
What are you doing?

201
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,120
What do you mean? Are you drunk?

202
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:36,480
What's wrong?

203
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,480
Disrespecting women?

204
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,919
Being a busybody, huh?

205
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,360
