206
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,799
What do you mean?

207
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,280
Nothing.

208
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,280
What's up?

209
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,680
Brother, I was wrong.

210
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,480
You, dance with me.

211
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,480
No need, brother.

212
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,360
Brother, I was wrong.

213
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:54,400
Let me tell you, it's a society ruled by law now.

214
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:55,720
In the past, I would have killed you.

215
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,120
Who are you going to kill?

216
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,040
Let go.

217
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,840
I was wondering why

218
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,240
