222
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,280
It's that guy who had a few too many drinks.

223
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,600
He insisted that the little girl,

224
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,280
no, that lady dance with him.

225
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,480
