226
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,480
Your dad was carrying out justice for heaven.

227
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:16,280
No, he was acting courageously for a just cause.

228
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,720
Right, it wasn't me. What was I doing?

229
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,480
I was just talking business with Dajuan.

230
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,410
Where is Dajuan?

231
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,840
Dajuan, what Juan?

232
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:23,840
Think about it carefully.

233
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,360
Chief Li.

234
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,800
Everyone stay there and don't move.

235
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:26,730
Don't follow me.

236
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,280
No.

237
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,720
What are you doing? I can do it. Don't move.

238
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,680
