267
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,240
Right.

268
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,120
You two look like the real father and daughter.

269
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,840
You two are putting on a double act here.

270
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,600
I'm doing this to develop my career.

271
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,320
Because she resigned and lost her job.

272
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,580
How can you live without a stable income?

273
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,840
Why are you dragging me into this?

274
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,120
Don't drag me into this.

275
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,240
If you get locked up again,

276
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,360
we'll be completely stable.

277
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,890
You'll be forced to behave.

278
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,000
You don't know how to be grateful at all.

279
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,320
Why are you going in there?

280
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,600
I left my drink samples inside.

281
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,860
I'm getting them back.

282
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,600
Uncle Li,

283
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,320
you still need to keep an eye on him.

284
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:42,250
Don't worry. I've been watching him for half my life.

285
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,820
What's wrong with you now?

286
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:55,600
Look, it's a red radish now,

287
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:59,000
but it might turn into a cigar in the future.

288
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,600
As long as I win this case,

289
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:04,000
I'll net 60,000 yuan.

290
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,480
Bragging again.

291
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,360
You can make 60,000 on your first case?

292
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,240
Who would believe that?

293
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,720
What's there to brag about?

294
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:15,240
I'm telling you, I'm made for this job.

295
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,120
This is just small potatoes.

296
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,480
In the future,

297
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,720
when I get a case worth tens or hundreds of millions,

298
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,520
you'll ride my coattails to the top.

299
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,080
You look like a dog to me.

300
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:25,210
Don't take me with you when you ascend.

301
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,120
I just beg you to be down-to-earth.

302
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,000
If you stop causing trouble,

303
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,240
I'll burn incense in gratitude.

304
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,760
You'll definitely get to burn it.

305
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:34,020
Burn a three-meter-tall incense stick.

306
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:37,240
I burn incense to pray for my son

307
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,120
to have a stable job

308
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,600
and marry a good wife.

309
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,980
You're being a bit greedy.

310
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:47,120
I already have a stable job now,

311
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,240
so why do I need a wife?

312
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,240
I don't have the time these two years.

313
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,440
Let's talk about it in a couple of years.

314
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:54,840
Just eat your food. You're always like this.

315
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,640
What do you think of Lawyer Xiao?

316
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,010
What for?

317
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,600
What do you think of Mr. Zhao?

318
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:15,240
No.

319
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,960
You're never serious.

320
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,320
What do you think of Mr. Zhao's legs?

321
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,060
It's fine. I'll just make money to treat him.

322
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,240
Morning, Ruoqi.

323
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:28,840
Morning.

324
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,440
So shameless.

325
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,480
Step aside.

326
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,160
Morning.

327
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,570
Good morning, Mr. Su, Mr. Ding.

328
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,480
Morning, Ruoqi.

329
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,720
I bought you some milk tea.

330
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,880
I don't know if you like it.

331
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:40,600
We do.

332
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,000
Thanks, Ruoqi.

333
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:42,880
You're welcome.

334
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:43,720
This one is a bit cold.

335
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,360
Okay.

336
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,400
Here, Mr. Guo.

337
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,120
Thanks.

338
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:50,360
Ruoqi, this milk tea is so good.

339
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,240
I've never had such good milk tea.

340
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,440
You like it that much?

341
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,840
I'll buy it for you again next time.

342
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,600
Thanks.

343
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:02,240
What's the difference between this and the one I bought you yesterday?

344
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,840
There's a huge difference.

345
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,720
None of you understand.

346
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,240
I understand.

347
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,480
I understand too.

348
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,480
You all understand.

349
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,650
I'll take this call.

350
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,240
Hello.

351
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,000
Zhang Guang.

352
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,500
I'm free. Go ahead.

353
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:27,840
Come in.

354
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,360
Good morning, mentor.

355
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,420
Watermelon Boba or Jasmine Milk Tea?

356
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,840
Neither, thanks.

357
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,840
You don't want either?

358
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,440
Did you read the cases I sent you yesterday?

359
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,120
I did.

360
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,840
Debt enforcement for Shanyuan Bank.

361
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,040
Eight cases in total.

362
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,200
Tell me about Ma Chao's case.

363
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,280
Ma Chao's case has dragged on

364
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:45,480
the longest.

365
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,240
Ma Chao and his wife, Feng Yan,

366
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:49,520
mortgaged their house for a bank loan ten years ago.

367
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:52,120
But they never repaid it in full according to the contract.

368
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:55,180
They even had an out-of-court mediation two years ago.

369
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,760
Compare the bank data as soon as possible

370
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:57,720
and make a spreadsheet.

371
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:59,200
Come to the court with me next week.

372
00:13:59,200 --> 00:13:59,880
Okay.

373
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:04,080
Mentor, by the way,

374
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,720
do we have any big cases

375
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,250
involving gangs recently?

376
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,410
I don't have any.

377
00:14:11,640 --> 00:14:13,300
Why don't you ask Lawyer Shen?

378
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,600
Then I'll go prepare.

379
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:22,000
Hello, Aunt Fang. I checked.

380
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,520
The two properties under Wang Lijuan's name

381
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,380
have never been mortgaged at all.

382
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:28,000
She just doesn't want to pay back the money.

383
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:29,320
How about this?

384
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,320
Bring the documents and the litigation fee,

385
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,320
and let's file the case first, okay?

386
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:36,600
Lawyer Xiao, I have something to tell you.

387
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,320
Let's meet at the teahouse.

388
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,000
Okay.

389
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,320
Thank you.

390
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,240
It's a bit hot.

391
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,320
Ms. Xiao.

392
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:14,840
I'm sorry.

393
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,840
I've made up my mind.

394
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,640
I'm dropping the lawsuit.

395
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:19,760
Dropping it?

396
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,760
Why, Aunt Fang?

397
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:25,090
You don't still consider her your friend, do you?

398
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:28,320
You're already taking a risk with the legal fees.

399
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:31,040
I didn't know I needed to pay court fees too.

400
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:34,960
My pension is all used to pay the loan interest.

401
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:38,120
I really can't afford the court fees.

402
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:41,240
No, we can figure out the money issue.

403
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,600
We'll find a way.

404
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,960
But if you drop the lawsuit,

405
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,480
the millions Wang Lijuan owes you

406
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,720
will never be recovered.

407
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,050
And when the time comes,

408
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,900
the bank will take your house.

409
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:54,240
Auntie, where will you and Grandma live?

410
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,600
I'll rent a place first.

411
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,480
I have my own two hands.

412
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,720
I can work and earn money.

413
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:03,290
I'm just sorry for letting you down, girl.

414
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:06,720
This pot of tea is the only thing I can treat you to right now.

415
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,840
Later, when I'm a bit better off,

416
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,440
I will definitely repay this favor.

417
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,440
But Auntie,

418
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,060
have you thought about it?

419
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,600
What kind of job will you find,

420
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,480
and how long will you have to work

421
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:18,200
to pay back those millions?

422
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:21,720
This might just be a lesson in my life.

423
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,320
What less...

424
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:29,240
What kind of lesson?

425
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,960
This should be a lesson for Wang Lijuan!

426
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,560
She's bullying you too much.

427
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,600
We have to teach her a lesson!

428
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:38,440
You clearly just wanted to help her.

429
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,080
What did you do wrong?

430
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,600
Auntie Fang,

431
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,840
do you trust me?

432
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,360
What the hell?

433
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,840
You paid the legal fees too?

434
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,120
Well, let's get this straight.

435
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,320
This money has nothing to do with me.

436
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,359
How can it have nothing to do with you?

437
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:05,880
You get 20% of the profits.

438
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,319
But you have nothing to do with the losses?

439
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,839
There's no such good deal in the world.

440
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:09,520
Exactly.

441
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,960
Risks must be shared.

442
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,720
No, you should have discussed it with me.

443
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:15,079
If we share the risks, I should have the right to know.

444
00:17:15,079 --> 00:17:16,119
Don't you know now?

445
00:17:16,119 --> 00:17:17,119
You know it now.

446
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:18,760
So that's it.

447
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:22,319
My goodness.

448
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:24,839
You're a grown man, getting all worked up over this.

449
00:17:24,839 --> 00:17:26,359
Fine, I'll pay the money.

450
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,960
It's not about who pays.

451
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,480
Then you pay.

452
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,480
I can't possibly pay.

453
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,440
I don't have the means.

454
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,200
I mean, what if something goes wrong?

455
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,240
What about the losses?

456
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,640
What could go wrong?

457
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,000
What losses? With Sister Long here,

458
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,200
what losses could you possibly have?

459
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,120
Really. But Sister Long,

460
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:40,080
you only have 20,000 yuan.

461
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:41,200
If you really pay it,

462
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:41,880
and something does happen...

463
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:42,880
What's wrong with you guys?

464
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,000
Why are you acting like him?

465
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,240
Remember this.

466
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:47,000
Your words are your feng shui.

467
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,480
You need to avoid jinxing it, understand?

468
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,520
Avoid what?

469
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:51,640
Who is it?

470
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,200
Coming.

471
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:52,760
Who is it?

472
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,240
Aunt Fang.

473
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,000
Aunt Fang, what are you doing?

474
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,840
You've helped me so much.

475
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:00,720
I want to do what I can.

476
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,000
No, no, you can't be serious.

477
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,600
How can we let you do this?

478
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:07,240
If you don't let me do something for you,

479
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:09,530
I'd rather not fight this lawsuit.

480
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,960
I hope you can understand me.

481
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:34,480
Come in.

482
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,140
Judge Wang.

483
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:38,240
You're just in time.

484
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,000
Hello.

485
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:41,560
Ma Chao, hurry up and explain your repayment plan

486
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,090
to Lawyer Li and the others.

487
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:44,920
Come, have a seat.

488
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:47,960
Hello, lawyers.

489
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,000
We've already promised Judge Wang

490
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:53,280
that we'll definitely pay off the money within two years.

491
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,940
What is the basis for your repayment?

492
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:00,480
I opened a factory before,

493
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:02,240
making plastic films.

494
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:05,240
But the profits haven't been good these past few years,

495
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:07,500
so I haven't been able to pay off the loan.

496
00:19:07,560 --> 00:19:09,480
I went to the south a few days ago,

497
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:12,080
and the people there really liked my products.

498
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:13,920
There are already several clients

499
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,440
who intend to place orders.

500
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:16,480
Just an intention.

501
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:17,610
No contract signed?

502
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:21,000
We'll go there in the next couple of days

503
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,280
and guarantee to get the contract signed.

504
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:23,880
Yes, we'll sign it very soon.

505
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:28,000
Here is the repayment record for the two of you over the past ten years.

506
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,480
It clearly shows

507
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:32,240
that you missed every single repayment.

508
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:34,440
And the repayment ability you mentioned

509
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,500
has no solid proof.

510
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,240
Based on the current situation,

511
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:39,720
the bank's application for a judicial auction of the mortgaged property

512
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:41,480
is completely in accordance with the law.

513
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,240
Attorney,

514
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,240
I don't mind if you laugh,

515
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,800
but the house we mortgaged

516
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:50,260
actually belongs to my parents-in-law.

517
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,920
The whole family lives in it.

518
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,640
If this house is really sold,

519
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:56,000
we will truly be homeless.

520
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,040
Yes.

521
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:00,840
Attorney Li, my parents are in poor health.

522
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,480
They really can't take this kind of stress.

523
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,400
Since you knew your parents were in poor health,

524
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:06,000
when you mortgaged the house,

525
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,680
why didn't you think it through?

526
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:10,560
It was all for the business back then.

527
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:13,200
Since you two are so confident in your business,

528
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,480
we can just proceed as planned

529
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:16,080
and auction the house first.

530
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,400
When you make money later,

531
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:19,880
you can buy a bigger house for your parents

532
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,460
and let them enjoy their retirement.

533
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,780
Right, Judge Wang?

534
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:27,560
Lawyer Li.

535
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:29,000
I think we can

536
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,330
discuss an extension with the bank again.

537
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:33,440
That's right.

538
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,480
This young lawyer is absolutely right.

539
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:36,720
Please give us a little more time.

540
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,560
Thank you.

541
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,560
I'm sorry.

542
00:20:39,080 --> 00:20:40,560
I have already communicated with the bank

543
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:41,920
multiple times.

544
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:44,000
The bank refused the extension.

545
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,860
So you two should still prepare to vacate the house.

546
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,240
You want to negotiate with the bank again.

547
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:55,000
Is it because you sympathize with them?

548
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:57,000
Yes, they look quite honest and pitiful.

549
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,760
And they have an elderly person at home.

550
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:00,800
You need to understand who we are representing.

551
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,280
Our client is the bank.

552
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,720
You must be clear about your stance.

553
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:06,050
What if there is still room to fight for it?

554
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,240
They are adults.

555
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:12,800
Adults must take responsibility for their actions.

556
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:14,680
And you must take responsibility for yours too.

557
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:16,410
If we can't reach an agreement,

558
00:21:16,520 --> 00:21:19,520
it will also send the wrong message to the other party.

559
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:20,800
Sorry, sorry.

560
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:22,810
What a coincidence.

561
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:24,920
You are Lawyer Xiao?

562
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:26,170
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

563
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:27,480
Wang Ruoqi.

564
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,000
Ruoqi.

565
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,720
I'm interning in Master Li's team now.

566
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,280
Who?

567
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:31,200
Master Li.

568
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:34,560
Master Li... Li...

569
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:36,080
That's good.

570
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,720
You are Director Wang's daughter, right?

571
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:38,240
Yes.

572
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:39,000
Nice to meet you.

573
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:39,480
Nice to meet you.

574
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:41,720
Then learn well from your Master Li.

575
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:43,040
And gain some skills, right?

576
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:44,570
Get back to work, Master Li.

577
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:45,520
I'm leaving.

578
00:21:49,520 --> 00:21:51,560
Lawyer Xiao is so cool.

579
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:53,800
No wonder she dares to challenge my dad.

580
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,320
Master, are you two very close?

581
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:58,620
Don't call me Master anymore.

582
00:21:58,760 --> 00:22:00,560
It sounds like instant noodles.

583
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,720
Master, do you need an umbrella?

584
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:04,720
Hold it yourself.

585
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:07,280
This is the situation right now.

586
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:09,520
Wang Lijuan isn't answering calls

587
00:22:09,520 --> 00:22:10,720
or replying to texts.

588
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:13,080
We don't know where she's hiding.

589
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:16,240
If all else fails, we'll have to serve by public notice.

590
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:18,330
Wouldn't that take another month?

591
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:21,240
Aunt Fang's loan is overdue.

592
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:22,360
The bank has already filed a lawsuit.

593
00:22:22,360 --> 00:22:24,690
They could take back the house at any time.

594
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,880
Aunt Fang can't afford to wait.

595
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:32,240
Xiao Li.

596
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:34,480
If I can corner her,

597
00:22:34,800 --> 00:22:36,560
can you rush over to serve the papers?

598
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:38,290
Of course you can, Lawyer Xiao.

599
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:40,560
If you catch them, call me anytime.

600
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,480
I'll bring the body camera over.

601
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,540
I'll try to ensure a smooth delivery.

602
00:22:45,760 --> 00:22:47,720
Excuse me, I'm looking for someone.

603
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,640
Has Wang Lijuan come back recently?

604
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:50,560
Who is Wang Lijuan?

605
00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:52,720
I think she's that tall woman.

606
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,480
Is Wang Lijuan home?

607
00:23:01,560 --> 00:23:03,040
The one you're talking about is Zhao Lijuan.

608
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,720
The chubby one is Wang Lijuan.

609
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:06,480
The chubby one is Zhang Lijuan.

610
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:07,480
Zhang Lijuan.

611
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,480
She doesn't live here.

612
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:10,480
I'm just renting.

613
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,000
Then how about this.

614
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:12,960
Give her a call.

615
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:13,800
Ask her to come over.

616
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:14,960
Just say there's a leak upstairs.

617
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:17,090
Who are you? Why should I listen to you?

618
00:23:22,520 --> 00:23:23,720
Is this Aunt Wang?

619
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:24,680
Wang Lijuan?

620
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:25,560
Who is it?

621
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,800
I'm from the courier station.

622
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:29,040
You have a package,

623
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:30,480
but the address is wrong.

624
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,720
I want to ask for your new address

625
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:32,720
so I can deliver it to you.

626
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:34,850
Scammers' whole families should die.

627
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:36,680
Are you done?

628
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:37,610
What do you want?

629
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:39,280
Buddy.

630
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,680
Can you make a call for me now?

631
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:43,280
I'm looking for Wang Lijuan.

632
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:51,130
Lawyer Xiao.

633
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:53,240
The bank called me again today.

634
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:54,960
Aunt Fang, don't worry.

635
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,490
I'll figure something out.

636
00:24:26,520 --> 00:24:27,240
Dong Beihu.

637
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:28,000
What?

638
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,010
Let's go.

639
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:29,960
Where to?

640
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:31,000
To catch someone.

641
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,780
See, you still need my car, don't you?

642
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:35,680
Get on my bike.

643
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:37,450
My bike is agile.

644
00:24:38,080 --> 00:24:40,010
Agile for what? Where are we going?

645
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:42,000
Wait, can this bike carry a passenger?

646
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,040
I'm quite heavy.

647
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:44,240
Slow down.

648
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:45,880
Tell me before you start moving.

649
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:46,760
Starting now.

650
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:51,040
How do you know Zhang Guang is here?

651
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:52,000
Don't worry about it.

652
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:53,440
I just know.

653
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,680
Play support for me later.

654
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:56,200
Don't worry, I'm the best at playing support.

655
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:57,530
I'll catch him for sure.

656
00:24:58,640 --> 00:25:00,100
Is that Zhang Guang's car?

657
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:02,440
It really is.

658
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,520
Quick, speed up.

659
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:05,680
Don't hit me, I got it.

660
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:07,880
Quick, charge, charge!

661
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:17,480
Lie down. Quick.

662
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,960
Lie on your stomach.

663
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,480
Are you okay, Huzi?

664
00:25:21,720 --> 00:25:22,200
Huzi.

665
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:22,880
Get out.

666
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:24,000
How do you drive?

667
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:24,720
You hit someone.

668
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:25,480
Come on, give us an explanation.

669
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:26,280
I hit you?

670
00:25:26,280 --> 00:25:27,240
How do you ride?

671
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,240
How do you drive?

672
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,720
Look, he can't even get up.

673
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:31,240
I was two meters away from you.

674
00:25:31,240 --> 00:25:33,000
You hit us from two meters away.

675
00:25:33,040 --> 00:25:34,240
Are you trying to scam me?

676
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:35,240
What did we scam you out of?

677
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:36,560
I've seen this kind of thing a lot.

678
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:37,640
I don't have time for you.

679
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:38,500
Get out of here.

680
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:41,640
Don't touch me.

681
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:42,160
I'm telling you,

682
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,040
if you touch me again, I'll call the police.

683
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:44,040
Call them. You call them.

684
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:44,480
I'll call them too.

685
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,680
Whoever doesn't call is a coward.

686
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:46,640
I'll take a picture first.

687
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:47,480
You think I'm afraid of you?

688
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,410
Take it. Take it.

689
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,480
Are you okay, Huzi?

690
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:50,960
I'm not even married yet, and my back is broken.

691
00:25:50,960 --> 00:25:51,720
Is this 110?

692
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:53,640
I'll ask you one more time.

693
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,880
Did he hit you or not?

694
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:56,760
If it's proven that you're deliberately scamming,

695
00:25:56,760 --> 00:25:58,680
you'll have to take full responsibility.

696
00:25:58,680 --> 00:26:00,200
Well, officer,

697
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:00,880
It's like this.

698
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:02,680
I tend to forget things when I'm anxious.

699
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:03,480
Let me think.

700
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,610
Yes, think about it.

701
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:06,760
Who are you?

702
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:09,000
Keep acting, you two.

703
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:11,240
Hurry up and arrest them both. Do society a favor.

704
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,640
Come on, show me your driver's license.

705
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,100
I have a driver's license.

706
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:16,170
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

707
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:20,000
Hurry up.

708
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,200
Come here, quick.

709
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:25,520
Hello, I'm from the court.

710
00:26:26,080 --> 00:26:26,640
Here.

711
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:32,320
Identity confirmed as Zhang Guang.

712
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:35,340
The court is now lawfully serving you a summons.

713
00:26:36,560 --> 00:26:38,440
This is my mom's summons. It has nothing to do with me.

714
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:39,320
I can't find her either.

715
00:26:39,320 --> 00:26:40,450
The one underneath.

716
00:26:42,360 --> 00:26:44,000
You must arrive at the location on time.

717
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,240
Look closely.

718
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:47,000
You are a co-defendant.

719
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:49,930
One for each of you. Don't fight over it with your mom.

720
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,800
You... you two.

721
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,280
It's too late.

722
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:58,480
If they obstruct us again,

723
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:00,480
I will apply for court enforcement.

724
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:02,480
Lawyer Li.

725
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:03,450
How did it go?

726
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:05,280
Ma Chao and Feng Yan

727
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:07,160
pushed the old couple out front.

728
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,480
They are quite old,

729
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:09,920
so we don't dare to use force.

730
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:10,720
What do you think?

731
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,800
Well, you guys go back first.

732
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:13,040
I'll go talk to them again.

733
00:27:13,040 --> 00:27:15,160
If that doesn't work, we'll take legal action.

734
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:15,800
Okay.

735
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:26,240
Sir, ma'am.

736
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,000
Hello.

737
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,720
You two live here?

738
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:41,480
In this room.

739
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:43,280
This room is quite big, isn't it?

740
00:27:43,760 --> 00:27:45,040
Lawyer Li, Lawyer Wang.

741
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,000
Mr. Ma, Mrs. Ma.

742
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:46,930
Have some water.

743
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:49,480
Please sit down.

744
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:50,480
Well,

745
00:27:50,880 --> 00:27:51,800
Lawyer Li,

746
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:54,160
you've seen our family's situation.

747
00:27:55,160 --> 00:27:57,240
It doesn't matter what happens to us,

748
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:59,400
but my parents are too old.

749
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,000
Please think of a way.

750
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,240
Lawyer,

751
00:28:03,720 --> 00:28:04,960
we two old folks

752
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,960
are not unreasonable people.

753
00:28:06,960 --> 00:28:07,480
Right.

754
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:09,640
We know that paying back debts

755
00:28:10,400 --> 00:28:12,400
is perfectly justified.

756
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:15,200
But we really have nowhere to go.

757
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:17,800
You can't let us sleep on the streets

758
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:19,720
or under a bridge.

759
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,000
Sir, ma'am.

760
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,680
I understand your thoughts.

761
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:24,680
But we still have to

762
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:26,640
move forward with this matter.

763
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:28,680
I have a suggestion for you.

764
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:29,440
You can temporarily

765
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:32,400
rent a place to live.

766
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:34,080
After this house is auctioned,

767
00:28:34,080 --> 00:28:35,240
with the remaining balance,

768
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:36,480
you can choose to

769
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:37,960
buy a smaller one

770
00:28:38,080 --> 00:28:39,640
or continue renting.

771
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,600
You've seen our conditions.

772
00:28:41,960 --> 00:28:43,420
We don't have any savings.

773
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:45,480
My small pension

774
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:47,680
is only enough for our living expenses.

775
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,240
How can we afford to rent a place?

776
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:49,720
Right.

777
00:28:49,720 --> 00:28:52,000
Lawyer Li, I beg you.

778
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:54,000
Please help us think of a way.

779
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:56,000
My parents are 80 years old

780
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:57,300
and in poor health.

781
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:59,480
If they don't even have a place to live,

782
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:00,960
how can they survive?

783
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:03,000
Mr. Ma, Mrs. Ma.

784
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:03,720
Sir, ma'am.

785
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,160
We are not here

786
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:07,440
to cause you trouble today.

787
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,480
Supporting the elderly is your obligation.

788
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:11,240
We are just here

789
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:13,370
to collect this property for the bank.

790
00:29:13,560 --> 00:29:15,560
Let's keep it decent for each other,

791
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:16,000
right?

792
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,480
If you refuse to comply,

793
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,640
we will have to

794
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:20,720
apply to the court for compulsory execution.

795
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:22,040
Who will suffer then?

796
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:23,280
Won't it be the elderly?

797
00:29:23,280 --> 00:29:24,040
Right?

798
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:31,920
How about this, you two?

799
00:29:32,200 --> 00:29:33,080
A friend of mine

800
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:34,400
has an empty house

801
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,760
that is unoccupied all year round.

802
00:29:35,760 --> 00:29:37,520
You can borrow it to live in for now.

803
00:29:37,520 --> 00:29:39,120
When this house is auctioned

804
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:40,660
and the money arrives,

805
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:42,000
you can pay the rent.

806
00:29:42,800 --> 00:29:44,130
The rent is negotiable.

807
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:45,640
We just need to sign an agreement.

808
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,320
For such an important matter,

809
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:48,680
you need to discuss it with your friend first.

810
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:49,560
I know this friend very well.

811
00:29:49,560 --> 00:29:50,720
He won't mind.

812
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,080
Don't worry, you two.

813
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:54,400
The house has good facilities

814
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:55,730
and is well maintained.

815
00:29:57,760 --> 00:29:59,720
Um, Mom and Dad,

816
00:30:00,040 --> 00:30:02,480
moving is quite a hassle.

817
00:30:02,560 --> 00:30:05,000
Can you two handle it physically?

818
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:05,960
Yeah.

819
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:07,800
Look at all the stuff we have.

820
00:30:08,040 --> 00:30:09,500
Why don't you reconsider?

821
00:30:09,760 --> 00:30:11,360
What's there to reconsider?

822
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:14,000
The lawyer has already made it clear.

823
00:30:14,560 --> 00:30:17,040
We shouldn't make things difficult for him.

824
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,560
Yeah.

825
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,570
Let's just leave it at that.

826
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,720
Doesn't this solve it?

827
00:30:25,520 --> 00:30:27,240
Did I do a good job this time?

828
00:30:27,480 --> 00:30:29,280
You handled it very thoroughly.

829
00:30:31,920 --> 00:30:34,040
Making this decision so impulsively,

830
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:34,920
aren't you afraid of bringing

831
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:36,160
unnecessary trouble to your friend?

832
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:38,480
No. Isn't there a lease agreement?

833
00:30:40,040 --> 00:30:40,800
Besides,

834
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:42,720
they can't really force the two elderly people

835
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:44,920
out onto the street to enforce it, right?

836
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:46,920
That's too pitiful and inhumane.

837
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:49,240
So you think my approach is not humane enough?

838
00:30:49,240 --> 00:30:52,680
At least it's conservative, rigid, and unreasonable.

839
00:30:53,000 --> 00:30:53,680
As lawyers,

840
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:55,410
although we serve our clients,

841
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:56,000
we can't be

842
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:58,280
completely led by the nose by their demands.

843
00:30:58,280 --> 00:30:59,680
We should have our own attitude

844
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:00,880
and our own judgment.

845
00:31:02,600 --> 00:31:03,520
You're right.

846
00:31:04,320 --> 00:31:05,720
I accept your criticism.

847
00:31:05,800 --> 00:31:07,460
I'll reflect on it carefully.

848
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:08,800
Since you care so much,

849
00:31:08,800 --> 00:31:10,960
I'll leave the follow-up of this case to you.

850
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:11,760
Really?

851
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:13,280
I get to do it independently?

852
00:31:13,280 --> 00:31:14,200
You trust me?

853
00:31:14,800 --> 00:31:17,330
What's important is that you trust yourself.

854
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:26,570
Recently, Mr. Chen from Shengkang Insurance

855
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:29,800
wants to replace his entire legal team.

856
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:30,920
Director,

857
00:31:31,080 --> 00:31:32,010
let me handle it.

858
00:31:32,280 --> 00:31:34,320
I've had drinks with Mr. Chen many times.

859
00:31:34,320 --> 00:31:37,040
Mr. Chen is a man of passion.

860
00:31:37,280 --> 00:31:38,840
He really loves to drink heavily.

861
00:31:38,840 --> 00:31:40,570
Lawyer Li doesn't drink a drop.

862
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:41,480
Would that be a problem?

863
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:42,200
Director, it's like this.

864
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:44,080
Shengkang Insurance's total payouts last quarter

865
00:31:44,080 --> 00:31:45,040
were 780 million.

866
00:31:45,040 --> 00:31:46,770
The number of claims was 9,300,

867
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:49,040
up 20.3% year-on-year.

868
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:51,200
If we can secure this project,

869
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:54,600
it will bring Honghu 5.6 million in revenue.

870
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,760
Mr. Chen does love to drink,

871
00:31:57,120 --> 00:31:59,960
but he is even more rigorous about business.

872
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:00,680
Yes.

873
00:32:01,560 --> 00:32:02,800
Mr. Chen is someone

874
00:32:03,480 --> 00:32:04,800
who clearly separates business from personal matters.

875
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:08,080
I think we still need to use our professionalism

876
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:09,680
to earn their trust.

877
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:15,970
Attorney Li.

878
00:32:16,600 --> 00:32:18,920
You really made a brilliant move.

879
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:21,240
What move did I make?

880
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:22,520
Ruoqi.

881
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:24,440
Isn't she with you?

882
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:27,380
Then the director must take good care of her.

883
00:32:37,360 --> 00:32:39,160
Aunt Fang, you can just sit here.

884
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,100
Right here.

885
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:52,460
Where should I sit?

886
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,690
In the presiding judge's seat.

887
00:32:55,320 --> 00:32:57,120
Long time no see, Attorney Xiao.

888
00:32:57,880 --> 00:33:00,360
What's wrong? Is Honghu not doing well lately?

889
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:02,220
Taking on all kinds of dirty work?

890
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:11,080
Just sit and rest. Just listen.

891
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,760
Leave everything here to me.

892
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:19,000
This case is quite clear.

893
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,200
It's best to mediate.

894
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:22,480
Reaching an agreement will save time.

895
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:24,920
Do both parties accept mediation?

896
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:26,320
Yes.

897
00:33:26,840 --> 00:33:30,300
Then please ask the other party when they will repay the money.

898
00:33:30,800 --> 00:33:31,800
Your Honor.

899
00:33:32,040 --> 00:33:35,520
Can I have a few words with the plaintiff, Ms. Fang?

900
00:33:38,120 --> 00:33:38,560
Huilan.

901
00:33:38,560 --> 00:33:40,290
You can just sit down and speak.

902
00:33:43,560 --> 00:33:44,360
Huilan.

903
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:47,480
We've known each other for almost 60 years, right?

904
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:49,480
I never thought

905
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:52,320
