906
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:55,320
My heartache is beyond words.

907
00:33:55,840 --> 00:33:58,840
Huilan, do you remember when we were little,

908
00:33:58,840 --> 00:34:00,700
how we played together every day?

909
00:34:00,840 --> 00:34:02,960
I waited for you after school every day,

910
00:34:02,960 --> 00:34:04,420
and we went home together.

911
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:06,000
Do you remember?

912
00:34:06,280 --> 00:34:08,840
If we had one piece of candy, we'd break it in half,

913
00:34:08,840 --> 00:34:10,100
one half for each of us.

914
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:12,679
You don't remember these beautiful memories?

915
00:34:12,679 --> 00:34:15,540
Right. That piece of candy was yours too, wasn't it?

916
00:34:17,600 --> 00:34:19,840
You can't be heartless.

917
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,800
You can't just focus on money.

918
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,199
Look at you,

919
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:25,260
putting decades of friendship aside

920
00:34:25,639 --> 00:34:28,280
and hiring a lawyer to scam your godson.

921
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:30,360
Ms. Wang, this is a court of law,

922
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:32,800
not a stage for you to distort the truth.

923
00:34:33,120 --> 00:34:35,120
You owe money and still think you're right,

924
00:34:35,120 --> 00:34:36,440
and you even accuse my client.

925
00:34:36,440 --> 00:34:37,719
Is this your deep sisterly bond?

926
00:34:37,719 --> 00:34:39,760
Exactly. Isn't this just shameless?

927
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:41,000
Who are you calling shameless?

928
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:41,320
You uneducated brat!

929
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,040
Silence in the gallery.

930
00:34:43,239 --> 00:34:44,159
I'm sorry, Your Honor.

931
00:34:44,159 --> 00:34:45,400
The defendant is avoiding the main issue

932
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:48,000
and confusing the public with irrelevant memories.

933
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:50,530
We strongly request to terminate her speech.

934
00:34:51,040 --> 00:34:53,840
Defendant, do not make statements irrelevant to this case.

935
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:55,960
Auntie, say no more.

936
00:35:00,200 --> 00:35:01,040
Your Honor,

937
00:35:01,680 --> 00:35:04,040
since the defendant has no sincerity in mediation,

938
00:35:04,040 --> 00:35:05,600
we have no desire to mediate either.

939
00:35:05,600 --> 00:35:07,130
Counsel for the plaintiff,

940
00:35:07,280 --> 00:35:08,080
our side is...

941
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:09,410
No, what does this mean?

942
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:13,440
Fang Huilan, I really didn't expect this.

943
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:15,320
You usually pretend to be generous,

944
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:17,120
