947
00:35:19,960 --> 00:35:21,080
What are you doing?

948
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:21,760
You...

949
00:35:23,600 --> 00:35:24,840
Aunt Fang, calm down.

950
00:35:24,840 --> 00:35:26,360
Wang Lijuan.

951
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:31,000
How can you blame me instead?

952
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:32,600
How can you...

953
00:35:33,680 --> 00:35:35,960
How can you blame me?

954
00:35:37,200 --> 00:35:39,040
Aunt Fang, are you okay?

955
00:35:39,040 --> 00:35:40,440
Aunt Fang, what happened?

956
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:41,000
Don't take it to heart.

957
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:41,440
What's wrong?

958
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:42,080
Sit down quickly.

959
00:35:42,080 --> 00:35:43,880
You look like a mop, talking over there.

960
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:45,520
Do you need medicine? I have some here, Agent.

961
00:35:45,520 --> 00:35:46,760
Don't be angry. Don't be angry.

962
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:47,840
Hold her up.

963
00:35:48,040 --> 00:35:48,520
Keep an eye on her.

964
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:49,160
Go, go, go.

965
00:35:49,160 --> 00:35:49,880
Watch carefully.

966
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:50,840
Don't worry. Don't worry.

967
00:35:50,840 --> 00:35:51,520
Are you okay?

968
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:52,160
You will get your retribution.

969
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:53,800
Your Honor, the plaintiff is in this condition.

970
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:54,880
Are we still proceeding with the trial?

971
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:56,520
I understand the details of the case.

972
00:35:56,520 --> 00:35:57,780
The trial can proceed.

973
00:35:59,520 --> 00:36:00,080
Sit down.

974
00:36:06,040 --> 00:36:08,520
Ma Chao's family has officially moved out of the old house.

975
00:36:08,520 --> 00:36:10,720
The house will enter the judicial auction process this week.

976
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:12,120
Everything is going smoothly.

977
00:36:12,120 --> 00:36:13,450
It's all under control.

978
00:36:14,080 --> 00:36:16,080
Good job keeping it under control. Keep it up.

979
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:18,000
The non-disclosure agreement for Qiming Technology,

980
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,600
I have finished drafting it.

981
00:36:21,520 --> 00:36:22,200
I'm sorry.

982
00:36:22,600 --> 00:36:23,000
I'm late.

983
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,000
I just had a trial.

984
00:36:26,600 --> 00:36:28,960
Why the long face? What's wrong?

985
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:31,960
I actually went up against Xiao Longnv in court today.

986
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,040
What a coincidence.

987
00:36:33,040 --> 00:36:35,320
Her temper is still so bad, and her tongue is still so sharp.

988
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:36,440
She totally roasted me.

989
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:37,440
What kind of case?

990
00:36:38,160 --> 00:36:39,490
A private lending case.

991
00:36:39,640 --> 00:36:41,160
An elementary school classmate of mine and his mom

992
00:36:41,160 --> 00:36:42,720
