993
00:36:42,720 --> 00:36:44,160
And then they didn't want to pay it back.

994
00:36:44,160 --> 00:36:45,820
Isn't that really unethical?

995
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:47,970
It's extremely unethical.

996
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:48,920
I didn't want to take it either.

997
00:36:48,920 --> 00:36:50,250
But they kept calling me

998
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:51,240
and telling me

999
00:36:51,240 --> 00:36:53,760
that they didn't expect to win and just wanted to stall for time.

1000
00:36:53,760 --> 00:36:54,800
You should still focus your energy

1001
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:55,880
on meaningful cases.

1002
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,940
Otherwise, it's just a waste of time.

1003
00:36:58,360 --> 00:36:59,000
Go on.

1004
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:01,080
Coming.

1005
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,280
Aunt Fang, hurry.

1006
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:10,560
Sit down, sit down.

1007
00:37:10,560 --> 00:37:11,280
Just lie down.

1008
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,320
Lawyer Xiao.

1009
00:37:12,640 --> 00:37:14,480
Our trial went smoothly.

1010
00:37:14,800 --> 00:37:17,240
We just need to wait for the winning verdict.

1011
00:37:17,240 --> 00:37:17,640
Yes.

1012
00:37:17,720 --> 00:37:18,440
Right now,

1013
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:21,800
the most important thing is to take care of your health.

1014
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:24,060
I just regret trusting the wrong person.

1015
00:37:24,760 --> 00:37:27,480
Otherwise, I wouldn't have ended up like this

1016
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:29,440
and implicated my mom.

1017
00:37:30,840 --> 00:37:34,640
Who hasn't trusted the wrong person in their life?

1018
00:37:37,160 --> 00:37:38,290
Slow down, Grandma.

1019
00:37:39,360 --> 00:37:41,090
Since things have come to this,

1020
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:44,000
