1023
00:37:54,560 --> 00:37:57,920
but we also have to fight this lawsuit to the end.

1024
00:37:59,880 --> 00:38:00,880
Attorney Xiao,

1025
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:03,880
my daughter is kind-hearted

1026
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:05,960
and easily swayed.

1027
00:38:06,280 --> 00:38:08,600
She was so focused on helping others

1028
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:11,960
that she ended up trapping herself.

1029
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:17,960
I'll have to trouble you with this lawsuit.

1030
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:19,720
It's my duty.

1031
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:39,400
Sister.

1032
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:41,600
The verdict is out. We won the case.

1033
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:44,330
When will the money arrive?

1034
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,600
Do you have a switch or something?

1035
00:38:45,600 --> 00:38:47,200
You bounce up whenever money is mentioned.

1036
00:38:47,200 --> 00:38:48,160
No, what are you talking about?

1037
00:38:48,160 --> 00:38:49,600
Isn't the lawsuit for money?

1038
00:38:49,600 --> 00:38:51,640
What's wrong with asking when it will arrive?

1039
00:38:51,640 --> 00:38:52,570
It won't arrive.

1040
00:38:52,960 --> 00:38:53,960
Wang Lijuan appealed again.

1041
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,560
Wang Lijuan appealed again.

1042
00:38:55,840 --> 00:38:58,280
Why is it taking so long?

1043
00:38:58,400 --> 00:39:00,240
Isn't it just about paying back the debt?

1044
00:39:00,240 --> 00:39:01,920
Will it take until my 80th birthday?

1045
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,600
Live to 80 first.

1046
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:05,250
Come, let me see.

1047
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:06,400
Let me see.

1048
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:07,000
I...

1049
00:39:16,160 --> 00:39:17,620
What's wrong with you now?

1050
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,810
My temper is flaring up.

1051
00:39:20,120 --> 00:39:21,600
Hold it in.

1052
00:39:22,520 --> 00:39:23,440
I can't hold it in.

1053
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:24,370
You guys hold it.

1054
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:40,000
Get out of the car.

1055
00:39:40,120 --> 00:39:41,320
Get out. Come on.

1056
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:41,850
Come out.

1057
00:39:42,200 --> 00:39:43,800
No, no, no.

1058
00:39:44,960 --> 00:39:45,560
You hit my waist.

1059
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:46,440
Zhang Guang.

1060
00:39:46,800 --> 00:39:49,060
You drive pretty fast in this little car.

1061
00:39:49,320 --> 00:39:50,360
Look at your hairstyle.

1062
00:39:50,360 --> 00:39:51,400
What, are you studying art?

1063
00:39:51,400 --> 00:39:52,520
Be polite.

1064
00:39:53,760 --> 00:39:54,560
Don't try to scam me.

1065
00:39:54,560 --> 00:39:56,620
Who do you think you're messing with?

1066
00:39:57,120 --> 00:39:58,280
No, what else do you want to do?

1067
00:39:58,280 --> 00:39:59,120
What?

1068
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:01,200
Your family owes people so much money.

1069
00:40:01,200 --> 00:40:02,680
Don't you know you should pay it back?

1070
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:03,400
Hurry up and pay it back.

1071
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,640
Yes, pay it back.

1072
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:07,240
How can I pay it back when I have no money?

1073
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:08,900
It's easy if you have no money.

1074
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:10,600
If you have no money, I'll bring these brothers

1075
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:12,000
to visit you once a day.

1076
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,080
When we get tired of visiting you,

1077
00:40:13,080 --> 00:40:15,440
