1078
00:40:15,440 --> 00:40:17,640
Yes, take off small parts.

1079
00:40:18,080 --> 00:40:19,840
I really have no money, brother.

1080
00:40:19,840 --> 00:40:21,440
It's useless even if you call me dad.

1081
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:23,520
If you don't pay back the money today...

1082
00:40:23,520 --> 00:40:24,000
No, no.

1083
00:40:25,160 --> 00:40:26,880
I'll put you on ice,

1084
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:28,600
and take a little off you every day.

1085
00:40:28,600 --> 00:40:30,520
I'll make a call, brother. I'll make a call.

1086
00:40:30,520 --> 00:40:31,600
Call in front of me.

1087
00:40:31,880 --> 00:40:32,880
No tricks. Are you calling?

1088
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:33,520
Right now, I'll take off

1089
00:40:33,520 --> 00:40:34,640
