1090
00:40:34,640 --> 00:40:34,960
No, no, no.

1091
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:38,040
Yes, take off the kneecaps.

1092
00:40:38,040 --> 00:40:39,520
Mom, hurry.

1093
00:40:39,520 --> 00:40:40,240
Mom, come quickly.

1094
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:40,480
Someone wants to

1095
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:41,940
take off my kneecaps, Mom.

1096
00:40:42,240 --> 00:40:43,960
Lawyer Li, this is what you asked me to find,

1097
00:40:43,960 --> 00:40:45,560
