1098
00:40:45,560 --> 00:40:47,560
It's sorted out. Please take a look.

1099
00:40:48,680 --> 00:40:50,240
Is that debt case finished?

1100
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:52,960
Not yet. They appealed again.

1101
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:54,600
I advised them,

1102
00:40:54,600 --> 00:40:56,520
but they are quite persistent.

1103
00:41:00,280 --> 00:41:02,080
I'll take a call. It's my client.

1104
00:41:05,600 --> 00:41:06,040
Hello.

1105
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:08,800
What?

1106
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,530
Zhang Guang was kidnapped?

1107
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:12,840
By whom?

1108
00:41:14,400 --> 00:41:15,840
Okay, Auntie. Don't worry.

1109
00:41:15,840 --> 00:41:16,400
Call the police first.

1110
00:41:16,400 --> 00:41:17,530
I'll be right there.

1111
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:21,520
Lawyer Li,

1112
00:41:22,160 --> 00:41:23,160
my... my classmate

1113
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:25,620
seems to have been kidnapped by Xiaolongnü.

1114
00:41:25,680 --> 00:41:27,440
Kidnapped by Xiaolongnü?

1115
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:28,720
Officer,

1116
00:41:28,720 --> 00:41:30,040
I swear on my great-grandmother,

1117
00:41:30,040 --> 00:41:31,760
I didn't even touch a piece of his dandruff.

1118
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:33,120
Give your great-grandmother a break.

1119
00:41:33,120 --> 00:41:34,360
You just didn't have the time.

1120
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:35,920
He wanted to take me apart.

1121
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:38,780
You scared my son so much his hands and feet are cold.

1122
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:40,280
You're in the mafia.

1123
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:41,320
What kind of good person

1124
00:41:41,320 --> 00:41:43,240
goes out with a bunch of hooligans?

1125
00:41:43,240 --> 00:41:45,120
Come back. What are you yelling about?

1126
00:41:45,120 --> 00:41:47,120
No, officer, they're not hooligans.

1127
00:41:47,120 --> 00:41:48,840
These are extras I hired.

1128
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:50,720
Strictly speaking, they're all performing artists.

1129
00:41:50,720 --> 00:41:52,160
Act one out, quick. Come on.

1130
00:41:52,160 --> 00:41:53,720
I said, a truly good horse,

1131
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:54,080
Go back.

1132
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:55,210
its head is the king.

1133
00:42:07,040 --> 00:42:08,600
What are you doing here?

1134
00:42:08,880 --> 00:42:11,610
To see how the opposing lawyer learned to kidnap.

1135
00:42:16,760 --> 00:42:18,520
I'm not a hooligan. I'm from a law firm.

1136
00:42:18,520 --> 00:42:19,120
Look.

1137
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:21,240
Dong Beihu, what are you doing?

1138
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:23,320
Both lawyers are here, right?

1139
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,960
Let's go to the mediation room to talk.

1140
00:42:24,960 --> 00:42:25,640
Right.

1141
00:42:25,640 --> 00:42:27,200
Give my son an explanation.

1142
00:42:27,200 --> 00:42:27,640
Hooligan.

1143
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:29,100
I was introducing myself.

1144
00:42:47,160 --> 00:42:48,560
I need to call Dong Beihu.

1145
00:42:48,960 --> 00:42:50,200
You're really crazy.

1146
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:51,680
Calling a Siberian tiger?

1147
00:42:51,920 --> 00:42:53,080
Isn't that an animal?
